WEBVTT

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.970
Seeking out a single ray of light,
hito-suji no hikari wo motome

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:34.210
All I can do is wander on, no matter how far.
hitasura doko made mo tada samayou

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:42.950
As I breathe a sigh not unlike surrender,
akirame ni nita tameiki wo tsuki-nagara

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:52.270
I don't want to fear how I've been hurt, all the time.
kizutsuku koto wo osoretaku nai yo itsu mo

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.650
Set me free now!

00:00:54.670 --> 00:01:01.060
Come on, let it all go, to the far reaches of time,
saa tokihanate subete toki no kanata ni

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:01.080
From that which binds the soul!
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:06.910
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo
From that which binds the soul!

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.200
For my heartbeat!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.690
Make freedom your weapon,
jiyuu wo buki ni

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:11.760
And you are sure to attain it!
kitto te ni ireru no yo

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.470
kitto te ni ireru no yo
And you are sure to attain it!

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:15.510
The power to believe and dream is there
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:21.590
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
The power to believe and dream is there

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:21.630
for you to go on living.
ikite yuku tame ni

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:25.960
ikite yuku tame ni
for you to go on living.

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:11.010
Are you worn out? You seem to have a bit of a fever.

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:26.960
Take this.

00:03:27.030 --> 00:03:28.660
You'll feel a little better.

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:57.450
How many days now has it been since then?

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:06.600
In order to avoid contact with the Blue, Marlene and I

00:04:06.670 --> 00:04:08.600
have detoured around the urban areas...

00:04:08.670 --> 00:04:10.940
Headed for Baikonur, near Moscow,

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:14.570
we've done nothing but travel these highlands, surrounded by all of nature.

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:50.240
What is it that's annoying you?

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:52.580
Is it what happened in Seoul?

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:55.710
There was nothing else I could do about that.

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:58.250
You must have realized that much.

00:04:58.320 --> 00:05:02.720
Yet after promising I would protect her no matter what...

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:05.020
I couldn't save even Yung alone...

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:10.930
You can't seriously think something could have come of that.

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:14.600
You and I survived. That's enough.

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:17.600
"Enough," you say?

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:18.870
That's right!

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:21.270
As long as Marlene and me, her Sample, are all right,

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:24.610
then anything that happens to the people still alive here is okay, isn't it!?

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:27.950
But what about Joey and Robert!?

00:05:28.020 --> 00:05:32.580
Your own people have died, yet you think nothing of that!? Huh!?

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:36.890
I took the best measures I could think of.

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:41.920
As a result, even if it means losing people, it's unavoidable in strategic operations.

00:05:42.970 --> 00:05:44.870
A dead person does not come home.

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:47.230
Do not get hung up on what has already passed.

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:49.000
Now that you know, let's go.

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:53.570
If we don't reach Baikonur by the deadline, we will be abandoned too.

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:57.910
I'm just saying, how can you so easily accept all this!?

00:05:57.980 --> 00:06:01.920
And after everyone has died on account of us! How!?

00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:05.080
You were in love with Joey, weren't you?

00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:12.930
...Love?

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:16.230
I mean, otherwise you wouldn't...

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:24.000
I saw you, the other night, Marlene.

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:25.940
You and Joey, just the two of you.

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:27.600
So, what about it?

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:28.940
Huh?

00:06:29.010 --> 00:06:36.210
I was only acting the way I felt like acting at the time. I had no special feelings.

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:39.220
You can't... that would mean...!

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:40.620
By tomorrow...

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:43.520
no, like this, it could be only several seconds,

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:45.890
this body could become just a lump of flesh.

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:50.900
What is wrong with trying to feel alive now with this body?

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:54.230
W- well that's... even so...

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:57.240
Don't think too much about the unnecessary.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:00.240
This is what it's like to live here.

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:13.910
H- hey, what are you...

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:14.920
Don't fuss.

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:17.580
The temperature is going to drop even further.

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:20.630
Unless you want to die, listen to what I say.

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:28.600
H- hey...

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:30.400
I told you not to fuss.

00:07:31.940 --> 00:07:37.140
Don't make this more difficult. Even I am worn out.

00:07:52.630 --> 00:07:57.830
What is wrong with trying to feel alive now with this body?

00:08:00.970 --> 00:08:06.240
By tomorrow... no, like this, it could be only several seconds,

00:08:06.310 --> 00:08:09.070
this body could become just a lump of flesh.

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:20.250
Where am I? What are you doing with me!?

00:08:20.320 --> 00:08:23.590
Stop! Don't go!

00:08:23.660 --> 00:08:28.930
I wish Yung could go to sleep for a long time, too.

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:33.440
When you're asleep, even the Blue aren't scary, right?

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:38.170
No! Yung!!

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:44.210
We don't even know when the disease will manifest.

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:46.140
Huh?

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:49.540
Why don't the two of us go, someplace far from here?

00:08:49.620 --> 00:08:50.480
Eh?

00:08:56.960 --> 00:08:59.550
Mister, there's something different about you.

00:08:59.630 --> 00:09:00.420
Mm?

00:09:22.650 --> 00:09:23.680
Blue...

00:09:25.650 --> 00:09:29.590
Anyhow, we're talking ten or twenty years here, right?

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:33.530
You're nothing more than one of the Samples we happened to recover.

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:36.620
It is my duty to bring you back with me.

00:09:47.280 --> 00:09:49.870
As a result, even if it means losing people...

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:52.380
If ever someone says they have a friend...

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:54.540
they would mean someone like you...

00:09:54.620 --> 00:09:56.740
Dead people don't come home.

00:09:57.620 --> 00:09:59.550
You would have rather died?

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:01.050
Dammit, dammit, dammit...!

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:02.990
Don't think too much about the unnecessary.

00:10:06.630 --> 00:10:08.890
This is what it's like to live here.

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:43.530
Even so...

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:45.530
I'm alive, right?

00:13:08.340 --> 00:13:09.780
Marlene!

00:13:21.020 --> 00:13:24.050
Marlene! Marlene!

00:13:36.310 --> 00:13:37.570
Are you okay?

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:05.130
Aren't you the terribly strong one today?

00:14:10.010 --> 00:14:14.670
I couldn't stand being turned into a human dumpling, not able to do anything.

00:14:16.350 --> 00:14:21.610
I'm not really sure what it is to be living here.

00:14:21.680 --> 00:14:26.280
But the truth is, I am alive now.

00:14:26.360 --> 00:14:31.820
And in the world I'm from, it's only natural for men to save women, you see.

00:14:32.290 --> 00:14:33.230
Women?

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:35.230
Huh?

00:14:35.300 --> 00:14:36.990
Only natural?

00:14:39.970 --> 00:14:42.560
T- that is...

00:14:42.640 --> 00:14:47.230
Anyhow, I've decided to do whatever it is I want to do.

00:14:47.310 --> 00:14:48.800
That's okay, isn't it?

00:14:51.980 --> 00:14:56.610
Well, let's go! If we dawdle around, we'll be abandoned, right?

00:15:43.300 --> 00:15:46.700
We've made it this far, haven't we?

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:51.830
I made a promise to someone.

00:15:51.910 --> 00:15:56.140
When I opened my eyes, the two of us would go off somewhere far away...

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:03.110
A friend, named Takashi.

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:09.260
Anyway, I don't suppose he would have ever thought I'd come to a place like this, huh?

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:23.840
I wish I could have shown this to him, too.

00:16:25.340 --> 00:16:30.040
I know! If he's gone into space, he might still be alive.

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:34.880
Yeah! In that case, we can just come here again, the two of us!

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:39.050
So I can't die, can I? Not yet. Isn't that right, Marlene?

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:43.220
Marlene?

00:16:43.290 --> 00:16:45.890
Unfortunately, I don't think so.

00:16:45.960 --> 00:16:50.900
Not even a hundred million people were able to flee to space. What's more,

00:16:50.970 --> 00:16:53.590
in order to prepare to fight the Blue that were to come,

00:16:53.670 --> 00:16:57.900
the segment of people who excelled in mind and body were given priority.

00:16:57.970 --> 00:17:02.170
By chance, I was placed on the Second Earth selection list,

00:17:02.240 --> 00:17:07.080
and picked up by a rescue squad when I was about 10.

00:17:14.320 --> 00:17:18.020
When I came around, my family wasn't there.

00:17:31.010 --> 00:17:33.630
A blazing fire and lumps of flesh...

00:17:39.610 --> 00:17:42.450
I don't have any other memories.

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:48.350
When the Blue appeared, nobody took them seriously.

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:50.690
They thought that there couldn't be anything living in this world

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:52.890
that could threaten mankind...

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:55.160
However, the reality was different.

00:17:55.230 --> 00:17:58.220
They would kill them again and again, but the Blue kept growing.

00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:02.570
Mankind tried using every conceivable modern weapon against them,

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:07.230
and by their own hand, enveloped the earth in crimson flames.

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:14.110
Which is why I can only observe this view, and the whole land, as if it were burning.

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:26.250
Marlene...

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:30.260
The only things I can remember are what came after I entered that dark,

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:33.600
greasy-smelling pilot training facility.

00:18:38.610 --> 00:18:43.640
All I had to do was submit myself to the hatred of Blue.

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:49.610
Operating the Armor Shrikes...

00:18:54.620 --> 00:18:55.750
...target practice...

00:18:57.290 --> 00:18:58.990
...hand-to-hand techniques...

00:19:09.300 --> 00:19:11.740
...mission simulations...

00:19:11.810 --> 00:19:15.610
I was taught everything I would need to live here.

00:19:23.650 --> 00:19:25.920
Yes...

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:27.680
Every imaginable thing...

00:19:36.260 --> 00:19:37.560
Don't make that kind of face!

00:19:37.630 --> 00:19:39.730
This is a ritual to keep you from dying!

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:41.600
It's a joyous ceremony, such that once you reach the battlefield

00:19:41.670 --> 00:19:45.400
and are attacked by Blue, you're certain to come back alive!

00:19:47.940 --> 00:19:48.740
...Alive...

00:19:58.290 --> 00:19:59.380
Alive...

00:20:06.290 --> 00:20:07.420
Marlene?

00:20:12.630 --> 00:20:14.230
Are you still going to go?

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:15.560
Together with me?

00:20:15.640 --> 00:20:20.230
I thought I told you. I am going to act the way I want to act.

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:23.640
Marlene, no matter what you say, I believe you.

00:20:23.710 --> 00:20:27.580
So let's go. If we don't go there, surely nothing will begin!

00:20:32.590 --> 00:20:35.520
Let's go. Together, to Second Earth!

00:20:35.590 --> 00:20:36.520
Alive!

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:38.390
Alive?

00:20:44.600 --> 00:20:46.190
Yeah, you're right.

00:20:46.270 --> 00:20:48.200
Let's go.

00:20:48.270 --> 00:20:49.240
Alive...

00:21:02.620 --> 00:21:03.610
Marlene!

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:07.750
Hey, wait up!

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:10.450
Marlene!!

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:41.390
Although the days when we smiled again and again
hohoemi kasaneta hibi ga

00:21:42.750 --> 00:21:47.520
Have passed away into dreams,
maboroshi ni natte mo

00:21:49.730 --> 00:21:56.670
I will surely not lose my way.
watashi wa kitto mayowanai

00:21:56.790 --> 00:22:02.840
To go on to the future,
mirai ni yuku tame ni

00:22:02.990 --> 00:22:09.260
To become an adult,
otona ni naru tame ni

00:22:09.620 --> 00:22:16.450
I again recall now the memories
mogaite kita omoide wo kokoro de

00:22:16.640 --> 00:22:21.610
twisting in my heart.
ima wa kurikaesu

00:22:21.710 --> 00:22:27.670
I'm living in one time,
hitotsu no toki wo iki

00:22:27.970 --> 00:22:33.950
While choosing two dreams,
futatsu no yume erabi

00:22:34.560 --> 00:22:41.430
And love taught me what it means...
soshite ai ga oshiete kureta yo ne

00:22:41.610 --> 00:22:48.290
to cherish someone.
hito wo omou imi

00:22:56.750 --> 00:23:01.690
You! What are you doing alone out in this desert?

00:23:01.750 --> 00:23:04.690
What is your unit and rank!?

00:23:04.760 --> 00:23:10.020
If you're a soldier, then you should know what it means to disobey orders!

00:23:10.100 --> 00:23:14.530
Stop it, Marlene! We owe this man for saving us!
